WEBVTT

00:09:29.813 --> 00:09:32.139
Today, it is a reality.

00:09:32.862 --> 00:09:37.645
Last month, we got the ultimate
academic endorsement to our model.

00:09:38.325 --> 00:09:41.898
University of the People
is now fully accredited.

00:09:42.743 --> 00:09:44.005
(Applause)

00:09:44.029 --> 00:09:45.253
Thank you.

00:09:45.277 --> 00:09:49.225
(Applause)

00:09:49.386 --> 00:09:53.536
With this accreditation,
it's our time now to scale up.

00:09:54.179 --> 00:09:57.324
We have demonstrated that our model works.

00:09:58.404 --> 00:10:01.392
I invite universities
and, even more important,